        "@type": "Question",
        name: "Can I play number grid puzzles on my phone?",
        acceptedAnswer: {
          "@type": "Answer",
          text: "Yes. Most number grid puzzles work beautifully on phones because the grids are tap-friendly and the sessions fit into short breaks. Sudoku and Nonograms have thousands of dedicated apps. Shikaku and Akari can be played free in any mobile browser on sites like GridPaw, with no download or sign-up needed."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
